WEBVTT

NOTE Ekoleddwa ne faster-whisper base.en; source=vidiyo/Arclight/EssimuAttach.mp4; sourceLang=olulimi Oluganda; omulimu=okuwandiika

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:09.630
Akatambi kano kawa ennyanjula ennyimpimpi ku kyuma kya Arclight.

2
00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:15.207
Bw’omala okugattibwa ku kinnya eky’ebbali eky’ekyuma ekikebera amaaso obutereevu kijja kuteekebwa butereevu

3
00:00:15.207 --> 00:00:20.785
waggulu w’amasekkati ga lenzi kkamera yo ey’oku ssimu gy’ekozesa mu vidiyo

4
00:00:20.785 --> 00:00:26.362
mode.

5
00:00:26.362 --> 00:00:30.978
Kkamera ejja kukola ng’amaaso go.

6
00:00:30.978 --> 00:00:38.479
Bw’oba otunudde mu kinnya eky’ebbali, okukakasa lenzi ki gy’ogenda

7
00:00:38.479 --> 00:00:45.980
layini ekituli eky’ebbali ne, ggulawo vidiyo waggulu ku ssimu yo.

8
00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.460
Teeka engalo yo ku buli lenzi mu kuddamu.

9
00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:55.380
Sikirini bw’ezikira, oba obikka ku lenzi ekozesebwa okukola vidiyo.

10
00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:59.460
Ggyako olupapula olwa kyenvu emabega w’ekikwaso.

11
00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:06.700
Teeka ensonga z’akasaale waggulu wakati wa lenzi ekozesebwa okukwata vidiyo.

12
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:09.420
Nywa ekikwaso wansi n’amaanyi.

13
00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:11.320
Ggyawo akasaale.

14
00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:14.780
Kati clip erina okuba mu kifo ekituufu.

15
00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:20.018
Okukwata vidiyo ku reflex switch ku dayirekita wa Talmosco, enkomerero y’ekikolwa

16
00:01:20.018 --> 00:01:21.140
amataala n’olonda

17
00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:24.300
ekitangaala ekisinga okwaka nga kinyiga emirundi esatu.

18
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.500
Kakasa nti ekifo we bateeka lenzi kiri waggulu.

19
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:33.020
Nga ettaala etunudde wala okuva ku ssimu ng’eyolekera omulwadde, teeka ettaala y’ekikolwa mu

20
00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:37.460
clip n’osika elastic waggulu okunyweza.

21
00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:42.220
Sindika amataala g’ekikolwa okutuusa lwe gatasobola kwongera kuseeyeeya.

22
00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:47.167
Ekinnya kya slide ekya dayirekita wa oscilloscope kati kijja kuba kiwedde butereevu

23
00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:48.580
wakati w’ekifo

24
00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.020
lens eyo ye kukwata vidiyo.

25
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.100
Okukwata eriiso ery’ebweru, kozesa enkomerero endala ey’ekyuma.

26
00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:02.458
Okukwata ekifaananyi kati, ggulawo vidiyo waggulu era zoom in ng’ojjuza screen

27
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:03.820
n’endowooza

28
00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:05.660
okuyita mu kinnya eky’ebbali.

29
00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.700
Nywa record era okole ekigezo.

30
00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.740
Nywa stop era otereke vidiyo.

31
00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:18.220
Kati osobola okugabana ne banno ku mikutu gya SQR egy’ensirifu olw’ekigendererwa kyokka kye wafuna

32
00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:26.590
conceptified okuva mu balwadde.

33
00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:43.330
Nyumirwa okukozesa amataala g’ekikolwa mu mulimu gwange.
